{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Execution serving reads, legacy-compatibility variants (Alpha 360 / Trade Replay)",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Existing session/workspace-authorized reads; this document only publishes the wire contracts the Alpha 360 and Trade Replay screens consume. A SCOPED_V2 workspace is answered with the v2 successor of the same route: dispatch on schema_version. No new route, flag or grant."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "/"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "portalSession": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/execution/resources/alphas/{resource_id}": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "executionAlphaResourceLegacyV1",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "resource_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9._:@-]{1,160}$"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "workspace_id",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 96
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "environment",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "enum": [
                "paper",
                "sandbox",
                "live"
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The body GET /resources/alphas/{id} returns while the workspace is NOT in SCOPED_V2. In SCOPED_V2 the same route answers execution.alpha-resource.v2 (execution-resource-scoped.v2.schema.json): raw authorized facts only, no alpha_label/version/health summary. The server, not the browser, selects the variant; a reader must dispatch on schema_version. Names: alpha_label is \"Unnamed alpha\" and deployments[].portfolio_name is null because no execution source publishes an alpha or allocation-level portfolio name (portfolios[].name is the portfolio relation's own name, join it on portfolio_id). Money is an exact decimal string. Synthetic fixtures are produced by the real service and do not certify production.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "../schemas/execution-alpha-resource.v1.schema.json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "409": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/execution/resources/alphas/{alphaId}/{relation}": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "executionAlphaSubjectRecordsLegacyV1",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "alphaId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9._:@-]{1,191}$"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "relation",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "enum": [
                "orders",
                "fills"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "environment",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "enum": [
                "paper",
                "sandbox",
                "live"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 500,
              "default": 200
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "after",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 4096
            },
            "description": "Portal-signed continuation from page.next_cursor."
          },
          {
            "name": "workspace_id",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 96
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "One keyset page of an alpha's or account's orders or fills from the Portal retained current window (not authoritative replay, not total history). `state` AUTHORITATIVE_EMPTY means the retained window holds no row for this subject; UNAVAILABLE means the relation was not published. `values` carries the relation's own published fields as strings/numbers/null; a missing key is absent, never zero. `timeframe.derived` provenance DERIVED_STRATEGY_ID_SUFFIX is a parse of the strategy id, not a source fact. In SCOPED_V2 the same route answers portal.execution.subject-records.v2 (execution-scoped-records.openapi.json), whose `values` are restricted to the reviewed scoped field set. The cursor is Portal-signed, bound to user, snapshot and limit; a stale one is 409.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "../schemas/execution-subject-records.v1.schema.json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "409": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/execution/resources/accounts/{accountId}/{relation}": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "executionAccountSubjectRecordsLegacyV1",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "accountId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9._:@-]{1,191}$"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "relation",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "enum": [
                "orders",
                "fills"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "environment",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "enum": [
                "paper",
                "sandbox",
                "live"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 500,
              "default": 200
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "after",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 4096
            },
            "description": "Portal-signed continuation from page.next_cursor."
          },
          {
            "name": "workspace_id",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 96
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "One keyset page of an alpha's or account's orders or fills from the Portal retained current window (not authoritative replay, not total history). `state` AUTHORITATIVE_EMPTY means the retained window holds no row for this subject; UNAVAILABLE means the relation was not published. `values` carries the relation's own published fields as strings/numbers/null; a missing key is absent, never zero. `timeframe.derived` provenance DERIVED_STRATEGY_ID_SUFFIX is a parse of the strategy id, not a source fact. In SCOPED_V2 the same route answers portal.execution.subject-records.v2 (execution-scoped-records.openapi.json), whose `values` are restricted to the reviewed scoped field set. The cursor is Portal-signed, bound to user, snapshot and limit; a stale one is 409.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "../schemas/execution-subject-records.v1.schema.json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "409": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/execution/views/observed-timeline": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "executionObservedTimelineV1",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "environment",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "enum": [
                "paper",
                "sandbox",
                "live"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "subject_kind",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "enum": [
                "deployment",
                "alpha",
                "portfolio",
                "account"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "subject_id",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9._:-]{1,192}$"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 200
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "after",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 4096
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "A bounded, non-causal merge of the subject's current-page orders, fills, sessions and command-journal rows by their OWN clocks, ordered by observed_at_ms, clock class, then source identifier. It is an observation of the current page, not an event replay: broker acknowledgement, correction tombstones and a global event sequence are published as unavailable_segments. An entry carries NO order status or outcome (a request, FE-054): an order appears once per clock it has (submitted, updated, created). Exact values are decimal strings; a malformed source value is null and named in rejected_exact_value_fields. `mark_context` is derived current marks, not OHLCV. In SCOPED_V2 the received/ingested/processed clocks and the projection received/refresh times are null. Cursor `page.next_cursor` is Portal-signed.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "../schemas/execution-observed-timeline.v1.schema.json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "409": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/execution/market/venue-candles": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "executionMarketCandlesV1",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "environment",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "enum": [
                "paper",
                "sandbox",
                "live"
              ],
              "default": "paper"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "venue",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "enum": [
                "BINANCE",
                "OKX"
              ],
              "default": "BINANCE"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "market",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "enum": [
                "USDM",
                "SWAP"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Must match the venue (BINANCE=USDM, OKX=SWAP)."
          },
          {
            "name": "symbol",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[A-Z0-9]{5,20}$|^[A-Z0-9]{2,12}-[A-Z0-9]{2,8}-SWAP$"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "interval",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "enum": [
                "1m",
                "5m",
                "15m",
                "30m",
                "1h",
                "4h",
                "1d"
              ],
              "default": "1h"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "from_ms",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "to_ms",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 6000,
              "default": 500
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Bars for one symbol and interval, every price the source's decimal string. `source_authority` VENUE_PUBLIC_MARKET_DATA is the venue's public kline feed (market context, never the Trading System's own history); TRADING_SYSTEM_DATA_LAYER is the Trading System market gateway, reached through GET /market/candles (execution-market-context) behind the same envelope when EXECUTION_MARKET_CANDLES_SOURCE=data_layer. `state` EMPTY is a real answer (no bar in the window, or the venue does not know the symbol: reason_code says which); UNAVAILABLE is an outage or a disabled/not-wired source and carries retryable. A truncated read filled its limit with room left in the window. No bar is ever fabricated or resampled.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "../schemas/execution-market-candles.v1.schema.json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "./execution-query-analytics.openapi.json#/components/responses/Problem"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "portalSession": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "cookie",
        "name": "__Host-portal_session"
      }
    }
  }
}
